          'MECHANICAL: hole patterns and thread sizes match; tolerance stack-up leaves clearance for the worst case, not the nominal; the load path is continuous and does not rely on a printed overhang; cable routing has slack for the full range of motion and a defined bend radius; thermal expansion or creep does not preload a joint incorrectly.',
          'SOFTWARE / DATA: message types and units identical (metres versus millimetres, radians versus degrees - the classic); frame conventions agreed (which axis is forward); timestamps and clock sources consistent; rates compatible with the consumer\'s buffer; endianness and field order for raw protocols; version negotiation or at least a version field.',
