          'DATA: USB CDC serial at 115200 baud, or UART at 3.3 V logic. Message format: a binary frame with a start byte, a sequence number, left and right wheel velocity commands as int16 in units of 0.1 mm/s, a checksum, and an end byte. Downlink at 50 Hz; uplink telemetry (encoder counts, current, voltage, temperature, fault flags) at 50 Hz',
          'LATENCY BUDGET: the command path from decision to motor terminals must be under 20 ms end to end, of which this interface may use at most 5 ms - stated so both sides design to it',
